# Verification

Completion means all applicable checks pass. Build does not replace tests, and “not run” does not mean “pass.”

Apply `VERIFY-01`. `.agents/ai/verification-routes.json` maps changed paths to
evidenced command records. The selector only proposes checks:

```text
python3 -B .agents/skills/build-and-test/scripts/select_checks.py \
  --project-root <repository> --changed-file <relative-path>
```

Its output always has `execution_authorized: false`. Review scope, evidence,
prerequisites, mutation/external effects, and task authorization before running
any selected command.

